        "description": "409 invalid_state (not Accepted, or before scheduledStart) or already_recorded. startedAt is the clinic clock. 422 unknown_service when any performedServices ID is absent from the seeded service catalog; no visit is stored. 403 not_assigned_veterinarian when the caller is not the assigned veterinarian and not an administrator. MVP-02A (D-41, D-47): an administrator may close/record a visit for any veterinarian, but may never supply clinicalNotes, diagnoses, medications, or followUpNotes in that call (rejected as 400 validation_error).",
